adaptation = "The source calls the score momentum but sorts it ascending and buys the ten lowest values, so its effective direction is 90-day reversal. The implementation exposes the continuous return across the current stock universe and leaves the source's price-above-5 and listing-age filters to the common universe contract. JoinQuant's dynamic real-price history is represented by the project's qfq convention."
